{
  "id": 129330859,
  "iid": 5334,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Qt: Collapse/Expand context menu for StatsTreeDlg",
  "description": "This MR adds `Collapse All` and `Expand All` items to the context menu in the statistics dialog.\n\nThe actions are defined in `tap_parameter_dialog` but are only effective if `addTreeCollapseAllActions()` is called from a child dialog. So, the menu items are not added to context menues in dialogs where they are not necessarily needed/wanted.\nCurrently, it is called by `stats_tree_dialog` to add the context menu items to the statistics dialog.\n\nThe reason for this MR is to overcome the very annoying clicking to close expanded nodes (`expand_all_threshold_` not reached) when there are\n- lots of sub-nodes\n- lots of nodes as child to the root node\n\nThis also addresses #17449",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2021-12-05T14:38:44.143Z",
